WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Task. You insert a coin, choose cola,
and the machine delivers it.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:11.200
Assisted. You insert a coin. The machine
reads the clock and picks coffee at 8 am.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.700
Agent. Nobody inserts a coin.
At 9 am the machine watches.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:18.300
At 11 am it's warm.
The machine sends water on its own.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.800
At 1 pm your water is still half full.
The machine waits.
